  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SAMDEF 2007-2016 MediaFund cons. loans - SAMDEF media fund</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SAMDEF 2007-2016 MediaFund u-kred</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Concessionary loan to Southern Africa Media Development Fund(Samdef), at zero rate of interest, with a two year grace period and with two   annual repayments with a 33% discount over a period of four years,    the grant element will thus be 50%. The loan will mainly be used for  expansion in the radio sector but also be used , together with funds  from other Samdef donors, for investements in printing presses.</narrative>
